I should start adopting this one. Currently I have armor randomly
assigned.

I use Z, Y, X, W, V, U for the invocation artifacts and Y for The
Amulet.

Mine (primarily for tools) go mostly by their initial...

a - primary weapon
b - bag of holding
c - wand of cancellation (continued with d and e if more than one)
(lowest free character slots) - lizard and luckstone (should change to
y, maybe)
f  - blindfold, towel (g - lenses, if any, otherwise...)
g - mirror (until Medusa[*])
h - any horn (or harp, if any; in bag)
k - key/lockpick/credit card
l - (magic) lamp
m - magic marker (in bag)
o - orb (sometimes), O - for quest orb artifacts
p - pickaxe (mostly in bag)
s - stethoscope (or a sack, if no stethoscope available)
t - tinning kit (in bag), sometimes primary missile
u - unicorn horn (v - optional unicorn horn[**], goes into bag)
w - magic whistle

[*] If a wielded mirror would provide reflection I might carry one for
longer.
